<title>UK: ATHLETICS-MACHADO TO RACE IN LONDON MARATHON. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-MACHADO TO RACE IN LONDON MARATHON. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>World marathon champion Manuela Machado of Portugal (corrects from Romania) will compete in the London Marathon on April 13, organisers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Machado won the women's world title in Gothenberg, Sweden in 1995 and months earlier finished second in the London race behind Poland's Malgorzata Sobanska.</p>
